mcprack (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add support for mounting mcprack under a URL sub-path (e.g. behind a
    shared Apache vhost at /mcprack) via X-Forwarded-Prefix; ProxyFix
    now trusts that header and rewrites SCRIPT_NAME accordingly.
  * Fix Alembic's env.py silently disabling every already-instantiated
    app logger (e.g. mcprack.telemetry) process-wide on first migration
    run, by passing disable_existing_loggers=False to fileConfig().

